        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 930RT, Square Lever with Modern Rectangular Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Square Lever with Rectangular Rose is both modern and beautiful. There is something so sharp about the square lever paired with the rectangular rose. Made by Omnia Industries, the 930RT Leverset is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors. Available in 8 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAll the <a href=\"/collections/omnia-prodigy-collection\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Collection</b></a> door levers features 28 degree retraction latches for that high end feeling of quality you expect Omnia Industries door hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 930RT Square Lever with Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>28° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 930RT Square Lever with Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Door Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Square Lever with Rectangular Rose, Omnia 930RT",
                "description": "Omnia 930RT, Square Lever with  Rectangular Rose - The Square Lever with Rectangular Rose is both modern and beautiful. There is something so sharp about the square lever paired with the  rectangular rose. Made by Omnia Industries, the 930RT Leverset is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch thick doors. Available in 8 finishes.",
